assets/images/signs/test/

# Per-session transient artifacts (S106 .gitignore extension 2026-05-10)
.claude/budget-reported-*
.claude/session-state.json.corrupt.*
.claude/pdr-deliberation-*.json
.claude/session-summary.md
# S108: the two patterns above and below were CONCATENATED onto one line with no
# newline between them, so neither was ever ignored and both files sat tracked in a
# PUBLIC repo. This is how REVIEW-PENDING.flag - which carries the whole review card,
# carry-forwards and owner quotes included - survived S107's untracking pass.
.claude/REVIEW-PENDING.flag

# Transient state-lock artifacts. S107 committed these by way of `git add -A`;
# they are per-process temp copies of session state and must never be tracked.
.claude/session-state.json.tmp.*
.claude/session-state.json.lockdir*/
